    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly presents this most attractive, light-filled, two-bedroom apartment situated on the third floor, featuring a designated parking space and a strong BER B3 rating. Offering a generous interior with a large terrace, this stylish home is located in the upmarket Spencer Dock development in the heart of the Docklands, within walking distance of a host of local amenities.\r\n\r\nDesigned by renowned architects Scott Tallon Walker, the apartment enjoys a bright dual-aspect interior with floor-to-ceiling glazing, a fully fitted kitchen, and luxury bathrooms. Residents also benefit from an on-site concierge service providing convenience and comfort.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, an open-plan living/dining room with access to the terrace, a spacious kitchen, two double bedrooms, master en-suite, and a main bathroom. The expansive terrace is accessible from the living area and both bedrooms.\r\n\r\nMust be viewed to be appreciated!\r\n\r\nMore about the location...\r\n\r\nThe Docklands is Dublin’s most fashionable and vibrant city district. A vast range of great bars and prestigious restaurants within a stone’s throw. These include the Harbourmaster Bar/restaurant Ely and CHQ just a few minutes’ walk away. Spencer Dock has an unrivaled level of public transport immediately available. The Spencer Dock LUAS stop is on a short walk providing easy access to the rest of the city."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway (7.48m x 1.51m)\r\nInviting entrance hallway with timber flooring, storage and intercom.\r\n\r\nLiving/dining room (4.38m x 4.37m)\r\nBright living/dining room with tilmber flooring boasting floor to ceiling glazing and access to the west facing terrace overlooking internal courtyard.\r\n\r\nKitchen (2.70m x 2.27m)\r\nFully-fitted kitchen with tiled flooring, steel backsplash, integrated fridge/freezer, dishwasher, NEFF oven and hob.\r\n\r\nBathroom (2.65m x 1.53m)\r\nTiled floor with part-tiled walls, including shower, WC, WHB, heated towel rail and large mirrored cabinet.\r\n\r\nMain bedroom (3.84m x 2.91m)\r\nLarge double bedroom with carpet flooring, access to east facing terrace and built-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nEn-suite (2.19m 2.02m)\r\nTiled floor with part-tiled walls, including bath with shower, WC, WHB, heated towel rail and large mirrored cabinet.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (3.37m x 3.33m)\r\nSpacious double bedroom with carpet flooring, access to east facing terrace and built-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nALL MEASUREMENTS ARE APPROXIMATE AND FOR GUIDANCE ONLY"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Designated parking space.\r\nBER B3 rating.\r\nThird-floor position with dual aspect.\r\nLarge terrace accessible from living room and both bedrooms.\r\nFloor-to-ceiling glazing providing excellent natural light.\r\nSpacious open-plan living/dining area.\r\nTwo double bedrooms with main en-suite.\r\nConcierge service for added convenience.\r\nUpmarket, well-managed Spencer Dock development.\r\nSuperb Docklands location within walking distance of amenities.\r\nMinutes from LUAS, DART, IFSC, Grand Canal Dock and city centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B3"
      }
    ],
